If you mix two of the monoisotopic variants together, elementary
chemistry suggests that an equilibrium of the following species will
form (taking H2O and D2O as the mixed variants):

H2O
D2O
HDO
OH-
OD-
DH2O+
HD2O+
H3O+
D3O+

Mixing all three would mean there was also:
T2O
DTO
HTO
OT-
TH2O+
THDO+
TD2O+
HT2O+
DT2O+
T3O+
